  "description_en": "Reviews images of milk powder can bottom codes by using recapture detection and multimodal large model-based element localization. The service determines whether an uploaded photo is recaptured and localizes visible milk powder products, can bottoms, and bottom code areas. It is suitable for milk powder channel inspections, can bottom code photo reviews, and manual verifications",
